  "description": "Welcome to the world of e-bikes. A quality aluminium frame, strong Shimano drive unit and externally mounted battery deliver versatility and reliability without breaking the bank.\n\nYou don't need to spend a fortune to enjoy the world of e-biking. Our budget-focused eBIG.NINE 300 SE models deliver a quality ride thanks to an aluminium frame and powerful but refined Shimano EP5 drive unit, but with the convenience of an easily removable externally mounted 504 Wh battery. Powerful, all-weather Shimano hydraulic disc brakes are on hand to keep control and the tough, long-lasting CUES drivetrain offers plenty of gearing for off-road adventures or the city streets.\n\nArguably the most versatile e-bike in our range, the tried and tested Shimano-powered eBIG.NINE embodies the perfect balance of day-to-day usability and sporty leisure activity. It's a bike that can handle off-road riding but can also handle the commute to work with ease - especially if you want to have some fun on the way. The high-quality aluminium frame features a semi-integrated 504 Wh battery to keep the price low and accessibility high, and carry a powerful and smooth Shimano drive unit that will power you up any hill. Ready to be equipped with mudguards and even a side stand, the eBIG.NINE will help you make the most of any situation.",
